      "audio": "docs/stories/narration/en/anbiya_zakariya_young_p1.m4a",
      "text": "This is the story of Allah's mercy to His servant Zakariya (peace be upon him). Zakariya had grown old, and his wife could not have children.",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "from": 0,
          "to": 79,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.6
        },
        {
          "from": 80,
          "to": 141,
          "start": 6.05,
          "end": 9.409
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "audio": "docs/stories/narration/en/anbiya_zakariya_young_p2.m4a",
      "text": "Zakariya called on his Lord in secret. He asked Him for a child from Him.",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "from": 0,
          "to": 38,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.24
        },
        {
          "from": 39,
          "to": 73,
          "start": 2.69,
          "end": 4.53
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "audio": "docs/stories/narration/en/anbiya_zakariya_young_p3.m4a",
      "text": "Allah answered his du'a and gave him glad tidings of a boy: ﴿يَٰزَكَرِيَّآ إِنَّا نُبَشِّرُكَ بِغُلَٰمٍ ٱسۡمُهُۥ يَحۡيَىٰ﴾ — interpretation of the meaning: 'O Zakariya, We give you glad tidings of a boy whose name is Yahya.'",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "from": 0,
          "to": 225,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 21.04
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "audio": "docs/stories/narration/en/anbiya_zakariya_young_p4.m4a",
      "text": "Yahya is a name no one was given before him. This is how Allah showed mercy to His servant Zakariya and answered his du'a.",
